{"strongs": "H6175", "word": "עָרוּם", "translit": "a.rum", "root": "ערום", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "crafty, shrewd, sensible", "definition": "עָרוּם adjective crafty, shrewd, sensible ; — 1. crafty , ׳ ע as predicate, of serpent Gen 3:1 plural as substantive מַחְשְׁבוֺת עֲרוּמִים Job 5:12 , ׳ לְשׁוֺן ע Job 15:5 . 2. in Proverbs, in good sense (opposed to אֱוִיל , כְּסִיל , פֶּתִי ); as attributive אָדָם עָרוּם Prov 12:23 a shrewd or sensible man ; ׳ ע as substantive = id. , v Prov 12:16 ; Prov 13:16 , so ׳ חָכְמַת ע v Prov 13:8 = prudent man Prov 14:15 ; Prov 22:3 ; Prov 27:12 plural עֲרוּמִים Prov 14:18 . עֵרָן , עֵרָנִי see below I. עור .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6398')\">BDB6398</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6175')\">H6175</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6397')\">BDB6397</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6399')\">BDB6399</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>עָרוּם</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>crafty, shrewd, sensible</highlightword>; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>crafty</highlight>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> as predicate, of serpent <ref ref=\"Gen 3:1\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(1,3,1)\">Gen 3:1</ref> plural as substantive <bdbheb>מַחְשְׁבוֺת עֲרוּמִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 5:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,5,12)\">Job 5:12</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְשׁוֺן ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 15:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,15,5)\">Job 15:5</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> in Proverbs, in good sense (opposed to <bdbheb>אֱוִיל</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>כְּסִיל</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>פֶּתִי</bdbheb>); as attributive <bdbheb>אָדָם עָרוּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 12:23\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,23)\">Prov 12:23</ref> <highlight>a shrewd</highlight> or <highlight>sensible man</highlight>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> as substantive = <highlight>id.</highlight>, v<ref ref=\"Prov 12:16\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,16)\">Prov 12:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 13:16\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(20,13,16)\">Prov 13:16</ref>, so <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>חָכְמַת ע</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Prov 13:8\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(20,13,8)\">Prov 13:8</ref> = <highlight>prudent man</highlight> <ref ref=\"Prov 14:15\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,15)\">Prov 14:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 22:3\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(20,22,3)\">Prov 22:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 27:12\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(20,27,12)\">Prov 27:12</ref> plural <bdbheb>עֲרוּמִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 14:18\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,18)\">Prov 14:18</ref>. </p></div><hr><p><bdbheb>עֵרָן</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>עֵרָנִי</bdbheb> see below I. <bdbheb>עור</bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 3:1", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 3, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Job 5:12", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 5, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Job 15:5", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 15, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Prov 12:23", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 12, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Prov 12:16", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 12, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Prov 13:16", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 13, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Prov 13:8", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 13, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Prov 14:15", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 14, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Prov 22:3", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 22, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Prov 27:12", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 27, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Prov 14:18", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 14, "verse": 18}], "flagged": {"hebrew": 